        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          Enhance your guests' experience with <strong>5 copies</strong> of the world's first independent digital nomad magazine. 
          Join our free waiting list for the next edition or get immediate delivery to anywhere in the world.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Key Features -->
        <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
